Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Cordée depends on the following packages. They are installed separately
(pip / npm), are not vendored in this repository, and remain under their own
licenses, all of which are compatible with AGPL-3.0.

Python (requirements.txt)
  Flask, Werkzeug, Jinja2 ............ BSD-3-Clause
  httpx, lxml, authlib ............... BSD-3-Clause
  requests, tenacity, openai, boto3 .. Apache-2.0
  mistralai, langdetect .............. Apache-2.0
  cryptography ....................... Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause
  beautifulsoup4, openpyxl ........... MIT
  pdfplumber, python-docx ............ MIT
  python-pptx, toml .................. MIT
  waitress ........................... ZPL-2.1

JavaScript (frontend/package.json, runtime dependencies)
  react, react-dom, react-window ..... MIT
  @tanstack/react-query, zustand ..... MIT
  lucide-react ....................... ISC
